10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n7zicFqrs1MQ7kNvwFlCIoS&_nc_oc=Adpfttf8twXqzlKdwnAhX7qZhK0X-B3Xh4LF_zEeqoJcLMcxW7nZweu8NtE8jOyvF9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2je9r3CyQxsXpU4ZOwtErkAJmMESnSn_ZaYHBt2TUHJA&oe=69EE204C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BULwt8gs6VwQ7kNvwH2U4NY&_nc_oc=AdrwP23OPAz-fpRvPsNNjDqnjhlAxR_5Munjx0dW21kktHK9LrKgg4Si5WQILnVCy94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0bAzlWYMQkZ8HLfKS1sDlgDxuyHzx_mTKvsefOxtAnsQ&oe=69EDF8FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nDoQjBSt_YUQ7kNvwFl6JNa&_nc_oc=AdrLzAPp0fnYaaJBDKebTUKjHSK8_pfHROsRr5y8uoketKcuK9AWkNYEMFvb8ZPp-Vs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1iCXyJ5h7Hvr7gbU99jYsZPywBKh-lYwFH9SnZQrRj2A&oe=69EE102B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore